          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Recent (2019) testimony of an old (2015) observation; unique observation of several luminous UFO in the night sky: lack of reliable information.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "cc53542716b3240778cff84f52dc5f89dd55a540c638143934b708393385b7f5"
